# Play structure

The quiz is not a single SPA file. Do not add modes or screens to `src/App.tsx`.

- Worlds have URL entries: `/geo`, `/football`, `/leaders`, `/math`, `/astronomy`, `/biology`, `/olympics`, `/cs`, `/food`. Picker is `/`. `/codes` redirects into `/geo`. Multiplayer hub: `/multiplayer` (not a theme world). Student packs: `/studio` (not a theme world). Empire economy: `/empire` (not a theme world). `/company`, `/shop`, `/state` are gone — `next.config.ts` redirects them to `/empire` permanently; do not recreate them. Design: `docs/economy.md`.
- World UI: `src/features/play/GeoPlay.tsx`, `FootballPlay.tsx`, `LeadersPlay.tsx`, `MathPlay.tsx`, `AstroPlay.tsx`, `ThemePlay.tsx` (biology, olympics, cs, food). Multiplayer hub: `src/features/play/MultiplayerPlay.tsx`. Packs: `src/features/play/StudioPlay.tsx`. Empire: `src/features/play/EmpirePlay.tsx` → `src/components/EmpireScreen.tsx`; rules in `src/lib/empire/rules.ts` (pure, shared with `/api/empire`), gates `src/lib/empire/gates.ts`, legacy conversion `src/lib/empire/migrate.ts`, tables `src/data/empire.ts`, Legacy missions/titles `src/data/empireLegacy.ts` (stamp sets `src/lib/empire/album.ts`), cosmetics `src/data/cosmetics.ts`, client store `src/lib/empireStore.ts`, server store `src/lib/empireServerStore.ts`, copy `src/i18n/empireCopy.ts`. Quiz powers, XP boost, avatar frames and share themes all live in Empire; there is no separate token/company/state store.
- Shared session/orchestration: `src/features/play/PlayApp.tsx` and `session.ts`.
- Country codes (TLD / calling / car) are geography modes, not a separate world. Quiz helpers: `src/lib/quiz/codes.ts`.
- 1v1 rooms still live on `/duel/[code]` (`src/features/duel/`). Launch from `/multiplayer`. Do not put duel polling or room state back into PlayApp.
- Quiz engine by world: `src/lib/quiz/geo.ts`, `football.ts`, `leaders.ts`, `math.ts`, `astro.ts`, `theme.ts`. Packs: `src/lib/quiz/pack.ts`. Shared types/helpers: `src/lib/quiz/core.ts`. Barrel: `src/lib/quiz/index.ts`.

When changing a mode, edit that world's quiz module and play file first. Do not read `src/data/facts/all.json` or `src/data/languageData.ts`. For UI strings, grep `src/i18n/strings.ts` / `src/i18n/extra.ts` for a key instead of loading the whole file.
